step4_generation.content:
We are fitting a concept bottleneck model (CBM) with 2 concepts to predict influenza (flu). We have 1 meta-concept so far:
{meta_concepts}

To improve the CBM, these are the top phrases from the residual model:
{top_features_df}

A positive coefficient means higher flu risk. A negative coefficient means lower flu risk.

Create five candidates for the 2nd meta-concept. Be systematic and consider all listed concepts.

Propose at least ten candidates in JSON format:
{
  "reasoning": "Step-by-step explanation",
  "concepts": [
    {
      "concept": "Does the note mention the patient having nausea?",
      "is_risk_factor": true,
      "words": ["vomiting", "nausea"]
    },
    ...
  ]
}
